  "user_request_original": "Optimize a 30-layer alternating HfO2/SiO2 multilayer coating on fused silica substrate with air incidence. Layer sequence: HfO2(1), SiO2(2), HfO2(3), SiO2(4), HfO2(5), SiO2(6), HfO2(7), SiO2(8), HfO2(9), SiO2(10), HfO2(11), SiO2(12), HfO2(13), SiO2(14), HfO2(15), SiO2(16), HfO2(17), SiO2(18), HfO2(19), SiO2(20), HfO2(21), SiO2(22), HfO2(23), SiO2(24), HfO2(25), SiO2(26), HfO2(27), SiO2(28), HfO2(29), SiO2(30). Initialize all 30 thicknesses with deterministic linear chirp: layer 1 = 60 nm, layer 30 = 159 nm, intermediate layers linearly interpolated. All thicknesses are optimizable variables with bounds [40 nm, 180 nm]. Optimize for maximum transmittance in 1530-1565 nm band and maximum reflectance in 400-700 nm band. Use gradient-based thickness optimizer. Evaluate at normal incidence (0 degrees), unpolarized or both TE/TM. Report best_target_score, valid_candidates, tightest_margin, thicknesses_nm for all candidates. Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 400-700 nm, 1530-1565 nm. soft objectives: high transmission in 1530–1565 nm; high reflection in 400–700 nm. behaviors to suppress or avoid: reflection in 1530–1565 nm; transmission in 400–700 nm. manufacturing constraints: total layer count not exceeding 30.",
  "normalized_request_english": "Optimize 30 alternating HfO2/SiO2 layers on fused silica starting from air. Initialize thicknesses linearly chirped from 60 nm to 159 nm. Allow thickness optimization within [40, 180] nm per layer. Maximize average transmittance in 1530–1565 nm and maximize average reflectance in 400–700 nm at 0 degrees normal incidence, unpolarized.",
